message: >-
  Internal pre-release metadata only; do not cite or redistribute this file. Alison Thomas
  is listed provisionally as project owner, not as an adjudicated sole author. Human
  contribution review, release version, committed revision, repository URL, and persistent
  identifier are unresolved.
title: >-
  Ghostlight: A known-truth astrometric microlensing calibration-sensitivity study
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Alison
    family-names: Thomas
abstract: >-
  An AI-generated synthetic, known-truth research-software case study for coefficient bias,
  interval coverage, and residual model adequacy when an offset unresolved blend is
  incorrectly constrained to the microlensed source position. Human scientific and copy
  approval remains pending, and no independent peer review has occurred.
keywords:
  - astrometric microlensing
  - calibration
  - Monte Carlo simulation
  - model misspecification
  - research software
